.TH BOOL 1
.SH NAME
bool \- unite, cut and intersect solids
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bool
.IR stream | \-
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Bool
reads a stream and executes its
.BR union ,
.B cut
and
.B common
statements,
.IR part (5),
in order.
Each of the named solids is replaced by the result.
Other statements are passed on.
.PP
Faces are planes, cylinders and cones;
two faces may meet along a line, a circle or an ellipse,
or overlap in a common surface.
.SH SEE ALSO
part(5), extrude(1), fillet(1)
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
The following are refused:
faces that meet on another curve, unless they are apart;
a result with a void;
a result in pieces that touch;
a result that touches itself along an edge.
The faces concerned are named.
